DIFME patch (ADR-023): OpenTelemetry in place of Elastic APM (same Apm API, Elastic-only options accepted and
ignored; OTLP to Alloy → Tempo); logs to stdout only (Alloy → Loki) in place of the Elasticsearch stream; tslib is a
runtime dependency (the compiled lib requires it: importHelpers); .npmrc without GitHub's registry.

